  "description": "MMS (ISO 9506) PDU catalog -- Confirmed-RequestPDU/ResponsePDU, Unconfirmed-PDU, Reject -- the MMS object model (Named Variable, Named Variable List, Domain, VMD), the MMS Initiate request/response negotiation (max PDU size, max outstanding calling/called requests, max nesting, supported-services bitstring, version/reject paths), and the unified error model mapping MMS Reject / confirmed-error / access-result failures. The Phase 2C core vertical slice (GetNameList, Identify, one typed Read, one typed Write, Confirmed-error/Reject handling) lives here first, ahead of full breadth.",
